
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>반려동물 등록 | PetCare</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <div class="white-card" style="max-width:500px; margin:40px auto;">
            <h2>🐾 우리 아이 등록하기</h2>
            <p>소중한 반려동물의 정보를 입력해 주세요.</p>

            <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
                <p style="color:red;"><%= error %></p>
            <% } %>

            <form action="/pets/register" method="POST">
                <p>반려동물 이름</p>
                <input type="text" name="name" required
                    placeholder="예: 초코"
                    style="width:100%; padding:12px;">

                <p>품종</p>
                <input type="text" name="breed"
                    placeholder="예: 브리티쉬 롱헤어"
                    style="width:100%; padding:12px;">

                <p>생년월일</p>
                <input type="date" name="birth_date"
                    style="width:100%; padding:12px;">

                <button type="submit" class="button"
                    style="width:100%; border:0; cursor:pointer;">
                    반려동물 등록하기
                </button>
            </form>

            <p style="text-align:center; margin-top:20px;">
                <a href="/">메인으로 돌아가기</a>
            </p>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>

